sionics", "Pocket Dimension", "Multi-Dimensional", "Quantum Displacement", "Save and Reload"], "quiet": 3, "loud": 6, "wallet": 4, "bank": 40, "playbookXp": 8, "attributeXp": 6, "builtInArmor": false, "actionMax": 4, "harmSlots": {"passing": 2, "major": 2, "critical": 1, "mortal": 1}, "source": "Blades ’68 playbooks v6 page 11; book v1.0.1 pp.334–340", "creation": "Place nine starting action dots, maximum 3 in any action. Record your mission and personal history. Later ratings use the usual maximum 3, or 4 with Mastery; record table-approved advancement deliberately.", "xpTrigger": "fearless conviction or lateral thinking", "abilityGuidance": "Each full playbook XP track gains a Time Traveler trait, a sourced ability, a temporal glitch and a mission detail. Choose the sourced ability from another playbook. Advanced Combat Reflexes gives fine unarmed attacks and first action; Psionics adds a mental power when pushing. Pocket Dimension costs 2 Instability plus 1 for each extension, relocation or passenger feature. Quantum Displacement costs 1 to teleport in sight; Save and Reload costs 5 to clear Harm. Multi-Dimensional uses Attune to recall another timeline’s experience. Record each use and resulting resource/Harm changes deliberately.", "conditionKind": "future", "fixedAbilities": ["Future Shock"], "abilityChoiceGuidance": "Future Shock is preselected. Record traits, sourced abilities, temporal glitches and mission details together at an advance.", "resourceGuidance": "Instability 9. Spend one downtime activity and one canister in a paranormal device to clear 5 Instability; cannot overindulge. Begin with 4 alluvium, capacity 8. Full Instability strikes out a Key for a temporal glitch and reveals a mission detail. Four glitches mean departure after the next score; record it deliberately."}'::jsonb);
